Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:54.72,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Fly through the sky, pass through the water and run over the land!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.48,0:22:57.54,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm called Kaga Rin. {Here she uses a very old japanese, looks like she is talking like a ninja or samurai}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.06,0:22:59.03,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.03,0:23:00.91,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Today, I start 1st grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.26,0:23:04.39,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,When I grow up, I want to be a ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.08,0:23:08.50,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi taught me about a secret training technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.91,0:23:10.86,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,First we need to plant a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.86,0:23:11.70,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.74,0:23:13.82,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll see more next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.99,0:23:17.19,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The next story is "My Tree."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.51,0:23:20.03,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Whose?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:56.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ashita no koto wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.23,0:00:59.65,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kore tte gisei to wa chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.65,0:01:01.35,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.35,0:01:04.97,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}batsu ge-mu ja nante omowanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.97,0:01:08.22,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}de nande na no ka wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.62,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:17.17,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nante mon ja nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.67,0:01:23.43,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}owaranai koto nante kono yo no doko ni mo nai
