Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.01,0:01:44.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}onna no ko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:47.54,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:54.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}bokura no negai wa Happy Happy Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.23,0:01:57.67,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}sonna hibi mo Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.11,0:02:05.38,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:56.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.23,0:00:59.65,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.65,0:01:01.35,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.35,0:01:04.97,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.97,0:01:08.22,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.62,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:17.17,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.67,0:01:23.43,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.54,0:01:27.77,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:30.57,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:34.12,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:37.25,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:41.01,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.01,0:01:44.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:47.54,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:54.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.23,0:01:57.67,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.11,0:02:05.38,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:20.53,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nichiyou no hareta hirusagari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:24.06,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kyou wa doko e yukou?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:31.02,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:35.62,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:40.97,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}terasu atatakai taiyou to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.99,0:20:46.05,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}tonari ni kimi ga ireba
