Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:20.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:24.06,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:31.02,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:35.62,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:40.97,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.99,0:20:46.05,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.05,0:20:50.13,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:56.00,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:21:00.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.21,0:21:06.88,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:11.04,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.70,0:21:16.66,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:21.52,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.04,0:21:30.58,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:17.53,0:00:18.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.66,0:00:19.24,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.16,0:00:20.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:27.50,0:00:28.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come over here.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:33.13,0:00:33.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It was just a dream.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:34.63,0:00:35.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:42.98,0:00:43.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.46,0:02:37.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here, I'll take one, too.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:44.01,0:02:46.02,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa used to make them, too!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:47.52,0:02:48.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.19,0:02:56.69,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You know what? I want my own knife.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.15,0:02:59.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're still a little too young...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:00.32,0:03:01.53,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They have ones for kids, too!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:01.99,0:03:02.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.33,0:03:09.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.62,0:03:12.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's eat.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:12.71,0:03:13.83,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We've gotta get going soon.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.83,0:03:14.29,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:29.06,0:03:31.02,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't the baby cute?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:33.81,0:03:34.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:38.57,0:03:42.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I am Kawachi, a relative of Kaga Rin-san's father.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:43.36,0:03:47.20,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, Rin-san and I... Rin and I are living together.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:49.58,0:03:50.16,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:50.62,0:03:53.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um... You are Yoshii Masako-san...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.87,0:03:56.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You {\i1}are{\i0} Rin's mother, correct?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.63,0:03:57.55,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:59.26,0:03:59.96,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.47,0:04:01.88,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.34,0:04:05.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to meet you in person and talk about something.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:06.05,0:04:10.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Anywhere near you would be fine, so if you could pick a place...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.10,0:04:12.94,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Place? Um...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:12.94,0:04:16.19,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I don't know... I guess in the shopping area, at the...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:16.19,0:04:20.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I don't have any idea where you live...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:33.87,0:04:35.42,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This is so cute!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,More crafts, Mom?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.17,0:04:39.13,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You made this flower, too?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:39.50,0:04:41.84,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. It's called embroidery.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.34,0:04:45.13,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! That's amazing!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:45.51,0:04:49.51,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,When you get a little bigger, I'll teach you how to do it.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.51,0:04:50.26,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:50.81,0:04:52.68,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Since you're so good with your hands, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:55.64,0:04:57.40,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,So what's your plan?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:59.02,0:05:00.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't say until I meet her...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:01.28,0:05:03.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, keep an eye on Rin while I'm out.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:04.11,0:05:04.70,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:06.70,0:05:08.20,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,It's important.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.70,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,So have a good long talk with her.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:10.16,0:05:12.37,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Mom's been looking forward to spending time with Rin-chan anyway.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:22.30,0:05:25.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is really close to Grandpa's house...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:26.55,0:05:27.51,Main Dialog,Waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:27.89,0:05:29.01,Main Dialog,Waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alone, sir?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:29.55,0:05:30.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,One more person will be coming.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.60,0:05:32.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Non-smoking, please...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:33.68,0:05:35.02,Main Dialog,Mother A,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Watch out! You're gonna spill!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.02,0:05:36.77,Main Dialog,Mother B,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}The stress just keeps building...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:36.77,0:05:38.15,Main Dialog,Mother C,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Believe me, I've been there!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:38.15,0:05:39.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Americano, please.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:39.69,0:05:41.61,Main Dialog,Waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Right, one Americano!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:42.15,0:05:43.40,Main Dialog,Waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like anything else?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:43.78,0:05:44.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.49,0:05:47.24,Main Dialog,Editor,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}This is very nice, Saionji-sensei!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:47.24,0:05:48.61,Main Dialog,Editor,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}But I'd expect no less from you.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:48.61,0:05:51.08,Main Dialog,Editor,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Now you just need to give each character some trauma,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.08,0:05:52.03,Main Dialog,Editor,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}two or three problems each...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:52.03,0:05:53.83,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}D-Don't you think that's overdoing it?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:53.83,0:05:56.33,Main Dialog,Editor,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}No, I think that'd be perfect!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:56.33,0:05:58.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't make sense...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.00,0:06:00.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,After she took the time to erase every trace of herself from Grandpa's house...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:00.71,0:06:02.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Does she still live near here?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:02.92,0:06:05.21,Main Dialog,Editor,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll see you soon, Sensei.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:05.21,0:06:06.80,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:08.22,0:06:10.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty careless for someone who ran off...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:10.68,0:06:12.43,Main Dialog,Boy A,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Mama, I have to pee!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:12.43,0:06:14.14,Main Dialog,Mother D,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Yeah, yeah. Just hold it a few minutes.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:19.35,0:06:21.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello? Where are you now?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.69,0:06:23.65,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm already in the restaurant.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.98,0:06:23.77,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I'm already in the restaurant.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:34.41,0:06:36.00,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,S-Souichi-san...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:36.00,0:06:38.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong. I'm his grandson.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:46.71,0:06:48.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's like a little kid...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:48.72,0:06:51.01,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um... I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:51.43,0:06:53.01,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that you look so much like him...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:53.47,0:06:54.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's okay...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:54.14,0:06:55.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, just recently, someone else told me that...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:57.85,0:06:59.48,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But still...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:59.48,0:07:01.98,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Souichi-san had a kinder look about him...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.65,0:07:03.11,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:06.15,0:07:07.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I brought a photo of Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:08.78,0:07:09.53,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:10.57,0:07:12.24,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It was taken at the beginning of the year.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:12.74,0:07:14.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,At a rice cake pounding party at her nursery school.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:18.37,0:07:19.46,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,She seems...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:19.87,0:07:21.58,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,so much like a young lady...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:30.38,0:07:33.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Before, someone called you "Sensei"...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:33.55,0:07:35.01,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,W-Were you watching?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:35.01,0:07:36.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But the name is...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:36.35,0:07:37.68,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That's my pen name.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.68,0:07:38.64,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:38.64,0:07:42.19,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm totally out of it after pulling an all-nighter because of deadline hell...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:42.19,0:07:42.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah...?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.90,0:07:51.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is that work the reason you left Rin behind?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:51.99,0:07:52.66,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:53.45,0:07:56.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And apparently you made Rin think that you were just the housekeeper,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:56.74,0:07:58.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but is that from when she was born?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:59.20,0:08:01.66,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Mm... My work {\i1}is{\i0} the reason.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.66,0:08:06.17,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But it's also true that I was Souichi-san's maid.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:06.84,0:08:11.72,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I had resolved not to think of Rin as my daughter as early as during pregnancy.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:11.72,0:08:14.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry. I'm not sure I understand...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:14.09,0:08:16.10,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,For the longest time, I wasn't popular at all...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:16.47,0:08:19.14,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Then, just as I was about to finally land a major assignment,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.14,0:08:20.27,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I found out I was pregnant...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:21.43,0:08:24.02,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,And it's not the kind of work you can do and raise a kid at the same time...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:24.02,0:08:26.86,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But Souichi-san encouraged me to have the child nevertheless...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:26.86,0:08:30.86,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Every day, I'd either work or stay in bed, and just got fatter and flabbier...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:31.86,0:08:33.49,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But even so, weirdly enough...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.49,0:08:37.70,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,When Rin was born, I thought she was so cute, and my heart went out to her.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:38.62,0:08:39.99,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Weirdly enough...?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:40.87,0:08:45.25,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That's why, even while telling myself that Rin wasn't my daughter,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:45.25,0:08:48.09,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I tried desperately to both work and raise her.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.50,0:08:52.55,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But it was tough trying to be a day person...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:52.55,0:08:54.76,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,And sometimes I have to go out at night for meetings,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:54.76,0:08:56.26,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,which means being up late...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.26,0:08:58.43,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It was just physically impossible...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:04.98,0:09:09.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I hear that Rin stayed with you in an apartment at night?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.52,0:09:09.98,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you ever go out at night then?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:12.90,0:09:15.20,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it was more the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:15.20,0:09:17.36,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Rin was already sleeping, so I went out for a little while...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:18.12,0:09:20.33,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,And sometimes Souichi-san watched her then...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:21.70,0:09:24.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Even now, Rin occasionally wakes up after midnight.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:25.62,0:09:29.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you ever think about how she'd feel when she did,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:29.50,0:09:30.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and no one was next to her?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:30.92,0:09:34.47,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But... how else was I supposed to raise a child on my own?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:34.47,0:09:37.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, my grandfather wanted the three of you to be a family, didn't he?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:40.76,0:09:45.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have a problem with me continuing to live with Rin?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:47.27,0:09:47.56,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:49.27,0:09:51.86,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm no longer Rin's mother,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:51.86,0:09:53.94,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,so I don't have the right to make those kinds of choices.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.53,0:09:58.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Even though it's beyond dispute that Rin was in your belly?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:58.32,0:10:00.57,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That has nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:01.49,0:10:04.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How do you actually feel about Rin?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:05.12,0:10:07.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is she important to you or not?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.71,0:10:11.13,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I don't know...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:26.60,0:10:28.94,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I just have one favor to ask...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:31.10,0:10:35.73,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,When that girl goes to school, please let her use your family name.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:35.73,0:10:37.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah? My family name?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.32,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If her surname is different from that of her guardian,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:39.32,0:10:41.16,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure she'll have a rough time...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:41.16,0:10:43.24,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Would you just promise me that?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:45.20,0:10:47.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know where you're coming from, but...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:47.50,0:10:49.58,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Still, I can't promise that.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:50.08,0:10:51.83,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's always been Kaga Rin up to now.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:52.21,0:10:55.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think a person's name is such a simple thing to change.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:56.05,0:10:57.71,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a woman,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:57.71,0:11:00.80,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,so I don't have any great affection for or attachment to my family name.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:00.80,0:11:03.47,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, it might change one day.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:04.47,0:11:07.85,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's a woman, too, so she probably feels the same way.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:07.85,0:11:10.98,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but Rin's still six.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:11.60,0:11:13.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And that's not what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:14.02,0:11:16.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, it's just your own personal opinion!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:16.36,0:11:18.19,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Only one thing is important!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:18.19,0:11:22.03,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Her name, "Rin," which Souichi-san gave her.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.03,0:11:22.78,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Now, excuse me!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:24.24,0:11:24.87,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.87,0:11:29.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a man, so I don't really get what you're saying.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:29.37,0:11:32.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,However, I can talk to her about it.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:32.42,0:11:34.08,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to her about it?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:34.08,0:11:36.30,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,You'd make that little girl decide?!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:36.30,0:11:37.38,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think that's cruel?!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:37.38,0:11:37.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:40.47,0:11:42.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thinking about what's best for Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:44.09,0:11:46.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And making the decision for her is what would be cruel.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:47.14,0:11:48.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,First, I've got to ask Rin how she feels.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:49.85,0:11:51.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,After that, the two of us will decide together,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:51.60,0:11:53.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and afterward, I'll let you know what the answer is.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:07.08,0:12:08.83,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,It sounds like she's no good!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:08.83,0:12:09.41,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:10.04,0:12:13.12,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Who would abandon a cute little girl like that?!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:13.12,0:12:14.04,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,It's irrational!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:14.04,0:12:17.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, she does at least worry about Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:17.38,0:12:19.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's just, she's a little odd.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:19.84,0:12:22.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's like she's not aware of the other people involved in her mess.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.55,0:12:23.84,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.84,0:12:26.26,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Naturally, a mother would worry about her daughter!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.26,0:12:28.26,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,But if she was really worried, she'd want to see her!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.26,0:12:32.10,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Now, now. We don't know the woman's circumstances. Have an orange.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.39,0:12:36.52,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,What did Grandpa ever see in her?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:36.98,0:12:40.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at this stage, that hardly matters...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:40.78,0:12:45.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The thing is, she demanded that when Rin starts school, she use my surname.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:45.95,0:12:48.24,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, well, I agree with that.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:50.12,0:12:52.96,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Of course a child should have the same family name as her guardian.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:53.37,0:12:55.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah... I understand, but...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:56.67,0:12:58.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How am I supposed to explain that to Rin?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:58.88,0:13:00.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When she's already got a name of her own...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:00.46,0:13:02.55,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, she's a girl,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:02.55,0:13:05.97,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,so her family name will change anyway when she gets married...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:05.97,0:13:07.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That again?!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:07.26,0:13:08.55,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,What again?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.97,0:13:11.85,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,It's much more preferable for her to use our family name at school
Dialogue: 4,0:13:11.85,0:13:14.52,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,than let someone joke about her differing name and hurt her feelings.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:15.56,0:13:18.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And you think she can keep all that straight?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.23,0:13:21.61,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,There's a lot going on, even in elementary school.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.03,0:13:23.99,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I just don't want things to be difficult for her.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:27.49,0:13:30.20,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, I'll adopt Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:30.20,0:13:30.66,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Wha...?!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:31.28,0:13:32.87,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,As long as she doesn't object.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:32.87,0:13:34.87,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That way, she'll really be Kawachi Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:34.87,0:13:36.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that way's more natural.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:36.92,0:13:40.50,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't talk so glibly about something that important!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:40.50,0:13:41.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not being glib!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:41.84,0:13:43.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is something that must be decided, am I right?!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:43.55,0:13:44.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's all the same whether it's now or later!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:44.88,0:13:46.17,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Easy, easy...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:46.17,0:13:47.38,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,It's {\i1}not{\i0} all the same!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:47.38,0:13:49.18,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it is! It absolutely is!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:50.10,0:13:53.27,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not passing the baton to anyone else.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.06,0:13:56.81,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That would be the worst thing I could do to Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.60,0:14:02.27,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If it's for Rin, I can accept my fate.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:05.94,0:14:06.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:07.61,0:14:09.61,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This is mine?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:09.61,0:14:10.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, it's yours.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:11.07,0:14:14.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But you can only use it when I'm next to you, got it?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:15.04,0:14:17.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you promise me that, you get to use the knife.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:18.12,0:14:18.75,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I promise!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:21.88,0:14:23.84,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You know what, I'll make curry for you!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.63,0:14:25.51,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You serious?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:25.51,0:14:26.17,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:26.92,0:14:28.51,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's make it tomorrow...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:35.52,0:14:36.10,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:36.10,0:14:38.64,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I forget, do I push or pull?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:40.10,0:14:40.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:41.23,0:14:41.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Give it here a sec...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:44.82,0:14:46.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, like this...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:46.82,0:14:48.70,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're good at that!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:48.70,0:14:51.41,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well, I lived alone for a long time...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.95,0:14:52.99,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Now you try.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:52.99,0:14:54.41,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Go nice and slow...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:06.46,0:15:07.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't drink the bathwater.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.01,0:15:08.67,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I won't.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:16.81,0:15:18.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Go up to your shoulders and count to ten.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:18.68,0:15:19.14,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:19.89,0:15:21.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,One...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:19.89,0:15:22.40,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,One, two...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:21.52,0:15:25.15,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,two, three...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:22.40,0:15:24.31,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,three, four, shut the door...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:24.31,0:15:27.69,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,five, six, pick up sticks, seven...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:25.15,0:15:29.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,four, five, six...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.95,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're counting slow!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:35.53,0:15:36.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be in such a hurry to eat.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:37.12,0:15:37.37,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.37,0:15:40.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:40.62,0:15:41.33,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.96,0:15:42.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:46.42,0:15:47.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Your curry's delicious!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:02.19,0:16:03.85,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do I have to do it as long as you?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:04.69,0:16:07.02,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no... That's okay...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:08.44,0:16:10.15,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mm... You know...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:11.36,0:16:13.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not your father...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:14.20,0:16:14.61,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:15.57,0:16:17.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm not your big brother either, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:18.79,0:16:20.91,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody thinks that!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:20.91,0:16:22.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That was just an example!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:22.21,0:16:24.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The question is, what am I then?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:25.04,0:16:25.58,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:26.46,0:16:27.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's my name...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:28.42,0:16:31.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, and this is only if you aren't against it...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:31.97,0:16:34.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What I'm trying to say... How should I put it...?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:35.05,0:16:37.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Uh... What do you...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:38.51,0:16:41.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, what would you think...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:41.06,0:16:42.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,about me becoming your real father?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:44.19,0:16:45.06,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:45.60,0:16:46.48,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,become my father?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:47.11,0:16:52.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So, if we did that, your name would become Kawachi Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:52.86,0:16:54.82,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi... Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:58.16,0:16:58.53,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:00.58,0:17:01.75,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"No"?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:01.75,0:17:03.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think it'd be better if you had a father?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:04.54,0:17:06.54,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My father is Grandpa.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:06.54,0:17:08.92,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Kaga Rin and I like it.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:09.38,0:17:11.00,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same name as Grandpa's.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:11.55,0:17:12.38,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's important.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:15.09,0:17:15.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:17.47,0:17:19.18,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi should just stay Daikichi.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:24.43,0:17:25.27,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:26.14,0:17:26.81,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:27.27,0:17:28.02,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:28.86,0:17:29.98,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is sweat!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:30.82,0:17:32.53,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's still only March...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:32.53,0:17:33.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:33.28,0:17:34.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just open your mouth!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:34.61,0:17:36.95,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It was open, but you were crying!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:36.95,0:17:38.16,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I said I wasn't crying!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:40.87,0:17:41.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Move your head up a little more.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:42.49,0:17:42.83,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:44.25,0:17:48.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You know, this'll always be your home...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:49.96,0:17:50.50,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:56.72,0:18:04.64,Main Dialog Italic,Song,0000,0000,0000,,We mustn't forget what we believe.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:05.18,0:18:13.61,Main Dialog Italic,Song,0000,0000,0000,,Because the morning will surely come.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:13.82,0:18:22.37,Main Dialog Italic,Song,0000,0000,0000,,We mustn't lose our dreams.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:22.37,0:18:30.00,Main Dialog Italic,Song,0000,0000,0000,,Because one day they will surely come true.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:30.00,0:18:38.47,Main Dialog Italic,Song,0000,0000,0000,,The first step... Step to tomorrow...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:38.47,0:18:46.93,Main Dialog Italic,Song,0000,0000,0000,,Starting today, everything will be new!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:46.93,0:18:55.48,Main Dialog Italic,Song,0000,0000,0000,,The first step... Step to tomorrow...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:55.48,0:19:00.70,Main Dialog Italic,Song,0000,0000,0000,,Build that courage up, nice and big...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:00.70,0:19:04.66,Main Dialog Italic,Song,0000,0000,0000,,And take that first step out!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:47.20,0:19:48.12,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:59.88,0:20:01.22,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to get fat, you know.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:01.88,0:20:05.05,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That's fine. Either way, I'm good for nothing.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:06.68,0:20:07.43,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Give me one.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:07.89,0:20:08.39,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:53.41,0:21:54.91,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Only babies get held like that!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:55.50,0:21:57.04,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's what Sayaka-chan said!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:57.04,0:21:59.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah?! That's not true!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:59.46,0:22:02.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There are times when even adults want to be held in someone's arms.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:03.42,0:22:05.17,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Adults?! Why?!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:05.17,0:22:07.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:07.30,0:22:09.64,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is it still okay to be held, even after I become a first-grader?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:09.64,0:22:11.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why, sure!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:16.10,0:22:19.02,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll hold you no matter how old you are...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.82,0:22:25.24,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:25.24,0:22:25.90,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:26.44,0:22:28.82,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I should've held you before.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:28.82,0:22:29.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:30.99,0:22:35.20,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll hold you the next time you cry, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:36.87,0:22:37.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What the...?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:39.75,0:22:41.25,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:42.54,0:22:46.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Am I raising Rin or is she raising me?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:47.67,0:22:48.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes I wonder...
